# This app currently reads no server-side environment variables.
#
# Gemini AI calls are fully BYOK (bring your own key): each teacher enters
# their own Gemini API Key in the app UI, it's stored only in that browser's
# localStorage, and sent per-request to the server via the x-gemini-api-key
# header. server.ts never reads a GEMINI_API_KEY (or any other) env var.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder in case server-side config is needed
# in the future.
